1
00:00:00,792 --> 00:00:02,460
It's late. I'll walk you home.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:05,463
Oh, no. That's okay.

3
00:00:05,463 --> 00:00:06,548
Let's go.

4
00:00:06,548 --> 00:00:08,508
No, really, I'm okay.

5
00:00:09,634 --> 00:00:11,302
Alright, I'll get going then.

6
00:00:11,303 --> 00:00:12,565
Hey, Ji-sung.

7
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:18,059
Can I come over
to your place sometime?

8
00:00:18,059 --> 00:00:19,894
My place?

9
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,857
Is that a bit much?

10
00:00:23,857 --> 00:00:25,191
No, not at all.

11
00:00:25,191 --> 00:00:28,194
Feel free to drop by anytime.

12
00:00:43,084 --> 00:00:45,378
Now lean against the wall.

13
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:48,381
Let's try a squat position.

14
00:00:48,673 --> 00:00:53,019
Knees at 90 degrees
back against the wall.

15
00:00:53,928 --> 00:00:56,931
Thighs parallel to the floor.

16
00:00:59,517 --> 00:01:02,520
Just hold it for 30 seconds.

17
00:01:04,314 --> 00:01:07,358
Keep the posture.

18
00:01:07,358 --> 00:01:09,736
You're doing great.
Ten more seconds.

19
00:01:09,736 --> 00:01:12,530
One, two...

20
00:01:13,412 --> 00:01:15,456
Hey, Ji-sung.

21
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:18,174
Hello.
